<title>USA: Ameritech gets UAL contract.</title>
<headline>Ameritech gets UAL contract.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ameritech Corp said Monday it had been awarded a five-year, multimillion-dollar contract to provide telecommunications services to UAL Corp, the parent company of United Airlines.</p>
<p>Ameritech said it will be the single-source manager of UAL's telecommunications services, including overall responsibility for its local voice network across the United States. UAL has about 500 U.S. locations.</p>
<p>Ameritech will also provide on-going technical and service support to UAL through its alliance service center.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
